# GEMINI_API_KEY: server-side only secret used by api/oral.ts (Vercel serverless function)
# to score oral-simulation answers with Google Gemini. Never exposed to the browser.
# Set it in the Vercel project's Environment Variables, or in a local .env for `vercel dev`.
# Without it, the app falls back to local keyword-based scoring — still fully functional.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
